  "body": "A draft PR to improve the way that the result is given back to the end-user.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- Solution to the optimisation problem and degeneracy are calculated in training vqa and no longer in the workflows\r\n- Add the hamiltonian representation to the PUBO problem\r\n- Merged the counts and probability log variables into measurement_outcomes\r\n- Added a new function into utilities: qaoa_wavefunction. (Similar in logic with qaoa_proabilities but outputs the wavefunction instead)\r\n- measurement_outcomes is now assigned when wavefunction, expectation, expectation_w_uncertainity or get_counts methods are called for the respective backends.\r\n- Updated unittests for the new changes\r\n- Added unittests that checks the results returned by all the simulator backends are consistent. (i.e. if optimization_progress is requested, the intermediate measurement outcomes are returned.) (https://github.com/entropicalabs/openqaoa/issues/35)",
